--- Overview
Replaces the PullOptions struct in vms/ociimage with functional PullOption values. PullVerified now pulls and returns a reference that names only the verified digest, with the tag dropped.

--- Key Changes
  * vms/ociimage/pull.go
    * New PullOption type, built with WithPullInsecure and WithPullConcurrency and applied to a private pullOptions.
    * PullOptions is renamed to PullSettings, which a Puller gets from ResolvePullOptions(opts...). If an option is given more than once, the last value applies.
    * Pull and Puller.Pull now take opts ...PullOption.
  * vms/ociimage/source.go
    * Source.PullOptions() now returns []PullOption, which can be passed straight to Pull or PullVerified.
  * vms/ociimage/verify.go
    * PullVerified takes opts ...PullOption.
    * It pulls and returns res.Reference.WithTag(""), the same digest-only reference Pin gives, because some tools won't accept a reference that has both a tag and a digest.
  * Tests
    * Updated for the variadic options.
    * Added TestPullOptions for default and override behaviour.
    * TestPullVerified now checks the digest-only reference.
  * Docs
    * doc.go and README.md updated to match the new API.

--- Breaking Changes
  * PullOptions struct is renamed to PullSettings. Callers now ask for a pull with PullOption values such as WithPullInsecure and WithPullConcurrency.
  * Puller.Pull, Pull and PullVerified signatures change from opts PullOptions to opts ...PullOption. Every Puller implementation must be updated.
  * Source.PullOptions() now returns []PullOption instead of a struct.
  * PullVerified returns a reference without a tag (digest only), where before it kept the tag alongside the digest.

